	And I click on the delete button for the team "Permission Partner"
	And I search the accounts details page using the keyword "Permission"
	Then I should not be able to view the team with the name "Permission Partner"
	And I should not be able to view a koroneiki team with the name "Permission Partner"
	And the team with the name "Permission Partner" should not be part of the account "Permis - ${staticProjectName}"
	When I search the accounts details page using the keyword "Permis"
